      <activity id="ac32c35e-2a5a-54e8-9bd4-7d39e55d3d98" activityNameId="a24fc4b8-1b28-5d8c-8f51-93452d23f2c6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium silicate, furnace process, pieces, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium silicate, furnace process, pieces, at plant
data based on a EMPA study, commissioned by the CEES.;
CAS number: 001344-09-8; 
UUID: f9b26992-64d5-3e83-a1db-81b0c5c25c7b
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium phosphate out of phosphoric aicd. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of 0.01 m3 air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: 91'000 t
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f9b26992-64d5-3e83-a1db-81b0c5c25c7b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
